sequenceDiagram
    participant Product as Product<br>[implements GapPeripheralResponse]
    participant CN as CN Peripheral<br>[implements GapPeripheral]
    Product->>CN: GapPeripheral.RemoveAllBonds()
    CN-->>Product: GapPeripheralResponse.NumberOfBondsChanged(0)
    Note over Product: Removes all stored bonds. The callback always reports 0<br>as the final bond count, regardless of the previous state.
